WEBVTT

00:13.490 --> 00:14.610
Sorry, Akane.

00:15.320 --> 00:16.410
Hmm?

00:16.780 --> 00:19.450
I... met a girl that I like.

00:28.840 --> 00:29.670
<i>Well...</i>

00:31.210 --> 00:35.430
<i>I did think
that he'd been acting cold lately.</i>

02:10.100 --> 02:10.980
What?

02:11.310 --> 02:13.690
You lost your boyfriend
to a girl from an online game?

02:15.530 --> 02:17.820
That's so funny!
What's up with that?

02:17.820 --> 02:19.820
Momo, you don't have to shout.

02:19.820 --> 02:20.950
So this game...

02:21.450 --> 02:24.450
It's the computer game you guys
play together, right?

02:24.450 --> 02:25.580
That's the one.

02:25.870 --> 02:29.040
Wow, who knew that
could happen in a game?

02:30.500 --> 02:31.460
<i>Akane?</i>

02:32.750 --> 02:35.250
<i>You should play this game with me!</i>

02:35.250 --> 02:37.010
<i>Oh, really? What is this?</i>

02:37.010 --> 02:38.920
<i>It's an online game that just came out!</i>

02:40.300 --> 02:43.300
I admit that I thought
he was something of a gamer,

02:43.300 --> 02:46.680
but I never dreamed that he'd
cheat on me with a girl in the game.

02:46.680 --> 02:49.270
And just look
at the last message he sent me.

02:49.270 --> 02:50.100
Hmm?

02:52.270 --> 02:53.610
Jeez, that's harsh.

02:54.110 --> 02:56.280
What are you supposed to say to that?

02:57.070 --> 02:59.400
But, hey, breaking up
was the right move!

03:00.990 --> 03:04.240
I know you’re still hurting
right now, Akane.

03:05.280 --> 03:07.580
I've got classes this afternoon,
so I'm out of here.

03:09.160 --> 03:11.870
Don't sit around dejected forever, okay?

03:11.870 --> 03:13.500
Make sure you come to class!

03:14.170 --> 03:16.750
Staying cooped up
is only going to make it worse!

03:33.270 --> 03:37.730
<i>It's not like I'm going to die
because I got dumped.</i>

03:37.730 --> 03:39.360
<i>Life's going to go on.</i>

03:39.360 --> 03:41.530
<i>And I can't cut too many classes, either.</i>

03:41.530 --> 03:43.410
<i>I need to start working soon, too.</i>

03:45.740 --> 03:48.240
<i>I wonder if he retrieved
that equipment yet?</i>

03:55.880 --> 03:58.300
<i>I was never into games before...</i>

03:59.260 --> 04:01.630
<i>but if it meant that we
could have fun together,</i>

04:01.630 --> 04:03.340
<i>that was
good enough for me.</i>

04:04.470 --> 04:06.680
<i>Hey, he's already unfriended me.</i>

04:07.180 --> 04:08.560
<i>Well, that was fast.</i>

04:09.180 --> 04:10.180
<i>I mean...</i>

04:10.180 --> 04:13.190
<i>I wish I hadn't bought all these items
if we were going to break up.</i>

04:13.190 --> 04:15.900
<i>I bought 3,000 yen worth
of in-game clothes!</i>

04:15.900 --> 04:16.230
<i>All that's left is this character
that I've leveled up for nothing.</i>

04:16.230 --> 04:18.980
Strike! Strike! Strike! Strike! Strike!
<i>All that's left is this character
that I've leveled up for nothing.</i>

04:18.980 --> 04:21.570
Strike! Strike! Strike! Strike! Strike!

04:21.860 --> 04:23.650
Power...

04:26.490 --> 04:27.660
Strike!

04:27.660 --> 04:28.490
Um...

04:30.540 --> 04:31.450
Hmm?

04:38.710 --> 04:39.670
<i>Huh?</i>

04:39.670 --> 04:41.880
<i>Who's this Noh mask Afro guy again?</i>

04:41.880 --> 04:43.880
<i>He seems kind of familiar.</i>

04:45.180 --> 04:46.010
<i>Oh.</i>

04:46.340 --> 04:47.930
<i>It's my guild-mate.</i>

04:48.300 --> 04:49.560
<i>Yamada.</i>

04:51.310 --> 04:51.930
Good morning, Yamada.

05:22.340 --> 05:25.300
<i>Yeah, that's him, all right.</i>

05:25.300 --> 05:28.550
<i>I thought he was kind of aloof
and unsociable.</i>

05:29.090 --> 05:32.560
<i>I mean, who takes two whole minutes
to write "hello" and "yes"?</i>

05:44.900 --> 05:48.990
<i>Not to mention, he looks like
a hardcore game addict. To answer him...</i>

05:49.110 --> 05:50.570
No, I'm not.

05:50.570 --> 05:54.500
I was hunting because my boyfriend
just dumped me and I was annoyed!

05:54.500 --> 05:56.290
And can you believe it?

05:56.290 --> 05:59.920
Apparently, it's thanks to this game
that I got cheated on in the first place!

05:59.920 --> 06:01.380
How awful is that?

06:05.380 --> 06:06.420
Oh...

06:06.420 --> 06:07.470
is that right?

06:13.640 --> 06:16.640
<i>So you have zero interest
in chatting with me!</i>

06:17.100 --> 06:18.890
Not on your life!

06:19.520 --> 06:24.230
<i>I was here first, so that means that you
should leave this hunting ground to me!</i>

06:24.230 --> 06:26.650
<i>I was told that that's
hunting ground etiquette!</i>

06:26.900 --> 06:28.400
<i>I'm sure this won't interest you,</i>

06:28.400 --> 06:30.530
<i>but I'm heartbroken after a breakup.</i>

06:30.530 --> 06:34.030
<i>I'm going to use this hunting ground
as an outlet for my stress!</i>

06:34.030 --> 06:36.660
<i>Please try for the Prophet's Stone
in some other channel!</i>

06:36.870 --> 06:39.420
<i>Because no way am I
ever giving up this spot!</i>

06:45.090 --> 06:46.090
<i>Oh, no.</i>

06:46.090 --> 06:49.300
<i>I was so annoyed that I lashed out
at this Afro stranger.</i>

06:50.340 --> 06:52.180
Well, yes.

06:53.220 --> 06:54.050
You're right.

06:58.680 --> 06:59.730
<i>I hate you, Yamada!</i>

06:59.730 --> 07:02.100
<i>I'm so going to log out
after you leave!</i>

07:02.100 --> 07:04.940
<i>This is why I can't stand gamer guys!</i>

07:09.950 --> 07:10.950
Huh?

07:11.610 --> 07:12.910
<i>An event?</i>

07:13.200 --> 07:16.490
<i>With avatars and various gifts
for attendees.</i>

07:16.990 --> 07:18.040
<i>Hey...</i>

07:18.040 --> 07:19.330
<i>it's nearby.</i>

07:26.750 --> 07:27.960
<i>Akane...</i>

07:27.960 --> 07:29.510
<i>let's stay together forever!</i>

07:31.630 --> 07:32.470
<i>Okay!</i>

07:39.350 --> 07:40.350
<i>Sorry.</i>

07:40.980 --> 07:45.440
<i>I met someone else that I like
in that game.</i>

07:49.570 --> 07:53.360
<i>And she says that she likes me, too.</i>

07:55.490 --> 07:57.330
<i>I'm really sorry.</i>

07:58.540 --> 08:02.160
<i>You're already going out
with that girl, aren't you?</i>

08:05.920 --> 08:09.170
<i>Will they be going
to this event together, too?</i>

08:12.220 --> 08:13.840
<i>Damn it.</i>

08:15.050 --> 08:17.810
<i>Am I just going to go down
as the one who got dumped?</i>

08:20.430 --> 08:22.350
- Akane!
- Huh?

08:22.350 --> 08:24.020
So you're finally showing up for class?

08:24.020 --> 08:25.480
Are you over him now?

08:25.480 --> 08:26.730
Momo!

08:27.980 --> 08:29.440
Hey, Momo,

08:29.440 --> 08:31.740
come shopping with me today
for clothes and shoes!

08:31.740 --> 08:32.700
Huh?

08:32.700 --> 08:33.780
Going somewhere?

08:33.780 --> 08:36.740
Yeah. I'm attending an event.

08:36.740 --> 08:37.740
Oh?

08:38.330 --> 08:42.080
Where I bet you-know-who
will be showing up as well.

08:42.080 --> 08:46.040
He can wallow in regret when he sees
how gorgeous I've become.

08:46.040 --> 08:48.710
Wow! You're nowhere near over him!

08:49.630 --> 08:52.510
This wouldn't be an event for that game,
would it?

08:52.510 --> 08:56.260
Of course it's an event for that game!

08:56.260 --> 08:58.600
More likely than not, he'll be there.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.930
So sad.

09:01.180 --> 09:03.020
Whatever you say!

09:03.020 --> 09:04.390
Wow.

09:04.390 --> 09:07.520
Just watch!
I'm going to make him regret

09:07.520 --> 09:09.690
ditching me for a gamer girl!

09:09.690 --> 09:11.230
He'll be kicking himself for dumping me.

09:11.230 --> 09:13.820
Just watch!
I'm going to make him regret it!

09:14.610 --> 09:16.450
We thank you for attending

09:16.450 --> 09:20.830
the Forest of Savior
Autumn Festival today!

09:21.370 --> 09:26.460
The PIN code you received at the gate
will expire at the end of December

09:26.460 --> 09:28.210
<i>The place is actually hopping.</i>
so please keep that in mind!

09:28.210 --> 09:29.210
<i>The place is actually hopping.</i>

09:30.040 --> 09:32.710
<i>There are way more people
than I thought there'd be.</i>

09:34.010 --> 09:34.840
<i>Wait.</i>

09:35.260 --> 09:39.720
<i>Hold up, am I headed
straight for bankruptcy this month?</i>

09:40.640 --> 09:45.560
<i>Still, everyone here is playing
the same game, right?</i>

09:45.890 --> 09:48.770
<i>I mean, there are tons of guys here.</i>

09:48.770 --> 09:50.520
<i>It's all so fascinating.</i>

09:50.860 --> 09:52.820
<i>I wonder
what kind of characters they play?</i>

09:53.230 --> 09:54.360
Takuma!

09:57.030 --> 09:58.280
<i>Taku...</i>

09:58.280 --> 09:59.110
<i>ma?</i>

10:02.030 --> 10:02.870
Ta—

10:03.080 --> 10:04.750
Let's move up to the front.

10:04.750 --> 10:05.580
Sure.

10:07.580 --> 10:09.000
W-Wait!

10:16.510 --> 10:17.340
What the...

10:18.050 --> 10:19.800
Ow.

10:20.180 --> 10:22.100
A girl just fell down.

10:25.180 --> 10:26.730
<i>How stupid is that?</i>

10:27.980 --> 10:29.190
<i>I want to disappear.</i>

10:30.150 --> 10:31.190
<i>I don't know why...</i>

10:31.770 --> 10:33.650
<i>but I think I'm about to cry.</i>

10:36.860 --> 10:38.030
Huh?

10:38.030 --> 10:39.200
Are you all right?

10:39.990 --> 10:42.660
O-Oh.

10:47.290 --> 10:49.370
<i>Whoa, he's super hot!</i>

10:49.790 --> 10:51.580
Yes! I'm totally fine!

10:51.580 --> 10:54.170
Oh, did I bump into you, by any chance?

10:54.170 --> 10:55.340
Uh, yes. Well—

10:55.340 --> 10:58.550
I'm so sorry!
I kind of spaced out for a second.

10:58.550 --> 11:00.300
I mean, I was deep in thought.

11:00.590 --> 11:02.720
I'm going through a hard time, and...

11:03.220 --> 11:05.140
I wasn't really paying attention.

11:06.680 --> 11:07.730
Oh...

11:08.640 --> 11:09.770
is that right?

11:11.900 --> 11:13.190
Sorry!

11:13.190 --> 11:14.940
It doesn’t matter, right?

11:16.570 --> 11:17.530
Right.

11:18.150 --> 11:19.490
I'm not interested.

11:21.700 --> 11:23.120
<i>Huh?</i>

11:23.120 --> 11:24.280
<i>That same line...</i>

11:24.780 --> 11:26.620
<i>I heard it recently somewhere.</i>

11:32.790 --> 11:33.750
Yamada?

11:36.050 --> 11:37.210
Afro Yamada?

11:41.930 --> 11:43.010
Who are you?

11:47.600 --> 11:49.100
Who are you?

11:50.730 --> 11:52.020
Um...

11:53.060 --> 11:54.190
You see...

11:54.810 --> 11:55.650
<i>Huh?</i>

11:56.320 --> 11:58.150
<i>Are his reactions slow?</i>

11:58.150 --> 12:01.200
<i>No, but I'm sure
I got a sense of Afro déjà vu.</i>

12:01.200 --> 12:02.700
<i>Am I just imagining things?</i>

12:02.700 --> 12:04.320
<i>It can't be a coincidence, right?</i>

12:04.320 --> 12:07.450
<i>Wait, he's looking at me
with such disbelief in his eyes.</i>

12:08.410 --> 12:09.790
<i>Did I get the wrong guy?</i>

12:10.290 --> 12:11.660
- I'm sorry!
- What?

12:11.660 --> 12:12.870
Hmm?

12:15.630 --> 12:16.710
<i>Takuma?</i>

12:16.710 --> 12:17.960
<i>And his new girlfriend?</i>

12:18.460 --> 12:20.340
What are you doing here?

12:21.050 --> 12:23.630
Takuma! Hey, what a coincidence!

12:23.630 --> 12:24.970
You're Mr. Yamada, right?

12:24.970 --> 12:25.800
Huh?

12:25.800 --> 12:28.010
Wow! It's you, isn't it, Mr. Yamada?

12:29.970 --> 12:30.850
Who?

12:31.270 --> 12:32.310
Don't you know him?

12:32.310 --> 12:34.770
He's this insanely famous pro gamer!

12:34.770 --> 12:35.980
What? Awesome!

12:35.980 --> 12:37.520
I'm telling you, he's incredible!

12:37.520 --> 12:39.400
Wow, Mr. Yamada, you play FOS?

12:39.400 --> 12:41.240
I'm a total fan of yours, Mr. Yamada!

12:41.240 --> 12:43.200
I'm always watching your videos!

12:43.200 --> 12:45.030
Wow, what a thrill!

12:45.030 --> 12:46.910
Man! Unbelievable!

12:48.200 --> 12:49.740
You're famous?

12:49.740 --> 12:51.700
Well, locally.

12:54.420 --> 12:56.210
What a coincidence, Takuma!

12:56.790 --> 12:58.500
You're here on a date, too?

12:59.710 --> 13:00.840
Huh? Akane?

13:00.840 --> 13:01.800
You're here?

13:01.800 --> 13:03.090
Yes, I've been here all along!

13:06.220 --> 13:08.510
What are you doing in a place like this?

13:08.510 --> 13:12.220
Well, I play this game, too, so what's
so strange about me being here?

13:12.220 --> 13:13.060
What?

13:14.060 --> 13:15.600
Don't tell me you're here alone?

13:16.650 --> 13:17.860
Of course not!

13:18.060 --> 13:19.320
Let me introduce you.

13:19.320 --> 13:20.610
This is my new boyfriend!

13:20.610 --> 13:21.610
No, I'm not.

13:24.030 --> 13:25.320
I'm begging you.

13:25.320 --> 13:29.160
Out of a warrior's mercy, can you find it
in your heart to play along with me?

13:29.160 --> 13:30.240
Are you serious?

13:30.740 --> 13:33.410
Just think of it as compassion,
and please...

13:33.410 --> 13:34.500
What?

13:35.540 --> 13:36.580
You can have this.

13:36.580 --> 13:38.920
I got it as a perk for attending.

13:38.920 --> 13:40.170
It's yours if you want it.

13:41.550 --> 13:42.840
Seriously?

13:42.840 --> 13:45.550
But this is a PIN code
for the Prophet's Stone.

13:45.550 --> 13:46.680
Uh-huh, uh-huh.

13:46.680 --> 13:48.090
It's a super-rare power-up.

13:48.090 --> 13:48.930
Uh-huh, uh-huh.

13:49.350 --> 13:50.760
<i>It is, huh?</i>

13:52.060 --> 13:52.890
I'm her boyfriend.

13:52.890 --> 13:54.020
He's my boyfriend!

13:55.060 --> 13:57.100
A-Are you kidding me?

13:57.600 --> 14:00.190
But I've been following you
for three years,

14:00.190 --> 14:02.780
and we've never once connected.

14:04.030 --> 14:04.900
I'm so bitter!

14:05.650 --> 14:06.780
Takuma!

14:07.860 --> 14:08.950
<i>I win!</i>

14:09.740 --> 14:12.240
<i>Not that this was what I had in mind.</i>

14:12.240 --> 14:12.910
<i>But look, he's bitter!</i>

14:12.910 --> 14:13.910
Bitter!
<i>But look, he's bitter!</i>

14:13.910 --> 14:14.290
Bitter!

14:16.080 --> 14:17.080
Takuma!

14:17.080 --> 14:18.830
Come on, cheer up!

14:18.830 --> 14:19.670
Yeah.

14:20.130 --> 14:21.460
Eri!

14:21.960 --> 14:23.300
Takuma!

14:23.880 --> 14:25.800
Eri!

14:25.800 --> 14:28.380
Takuma!

14:30.890 --> 14:32.510
Welcome!

14:36.850 --> 14:38.140
What is this?

14:38.640 --> 14:40.400
What do you call this feeling?

14:41.190 --> 14:44.900
Like I won the battle, but lost the war?

14:45.400 --> 14:48.070
You didn't even win the battle,
either, did you,

14:48.070 --> 14:48.900
from the looks of it.

14:50.610 --> 14:53.080
I knew it.
You're Afro Yamada, aren't you?

14:53.580 --> 14:54.540
Right.

14:55.040 --> 14:57.040
By the way, can I go home now?

14:57.040 --> 14:58.460
<i>It's Yamada, all right.</i>

14:58.790 --> 15:00.830
Would it kill you to keep me company?

15:00.830 --> 15:02.590
I don't want to be alone!

15:09.380 --> 15:10.430
That girl...

15:11.970 --> 15:13.800
She was so beautiful.

15:14.810 --> 15:15.680
Who?

15:16.180 --> 15:18.060
Takuma's girlfriend.

15:18.060 --> 15:19.730
First off, who's Takuma?

15:20.020 --> 15:21.810
My ex-boyfriend, that's who!

15:21.810 --> 15:24.020
I told you about him in the game chat!

15:25.020 --> 15:26.230
Right.

15:26.650 --> 15:29.490
So you're that inept paladin, huh?

15:30.240 --> 15:31.780
You only just realized that now?

15:31.780 --> 15:34.410
Well, isn’t it amazing at all
that I realized it?

15:36.370 --> 15:37.450
Welcome!

15:39.580 --> 15:43.710
The truth is, today I was going
to dress up and flaunt myself,

15:43.710 --> 15:46.090
and make him regret dumping me.

15:47.840 --> 15:51.840
But I never planned
on having to see them like that.

15:59.640 --> 16:00.680
Um...

16:03.350 --> 16:06.150
Since it seems we'll be here a while,
can I order another cola?

16:06.150 --> 16:07.270
Please, be my guest!

16:07.270 --> 16:09.030
My pleasure!

16:09.030 --> 16:12.280
<i>Oh, I'm starting to feel drained.</i>

16:12.950 --> 16:16.910
By the way, about what Takuma said,
what's a pro gamer?

16:16.910 --> 16:20.500
Someone who gets paid by sponsors
to play games, I guess?

16:21.000 --> 16:22.750
What? Sponsors?

16:22.750 --> 16:23.830
You're kidding me, right?

16:23.830 --> 16:24.920
No, it's true.

16:24.920 --> 16:27.670
Then you're getting paid to play FOS, too?

16:27.670 --> 16:29.710
That's just a break for me.

16:29.710 --> 16:31.260
I mainly play FPS games.

16:32.420 --> 16:33.430
Oh?

16:33.760 --> 16:34.800
What are those?

16:34.800 --> 16:36.550
Uh, don’t worry about it.

16:41.810 --> 16:43.980
Don't you think
you're a little cold, Yamada?

16:44.480 --> 16:46.810
That won’t make you
too popular with the girls.

16:47.360 --> 16:48.610
I'm not.

16:48.610 --> 16:50.070
I've never had a girlfriend, either.

16:50.820 --> 16:52.570
What? That can't be true!

16:53.200 --> 16:55.870
You just said so yourself, didn't you?

16:55.870 --> 16:57.450
Well, yeah, I did say that, but...

16:57.780 --> 17:00.540
You're so good-looking.
How can you not be popular?

17:01.500 --> 17:03.000
I'm not interested.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.290
In romance and all.

17:04.290 --> 17:05.830
I don't get what that's all about.

17:06.040 --> 17:07.460
Wow.

17:09.130 --> 17:10.460
What a waste of good looks.

17:11.010 --> 17:12.970
Gaming is more fun for me.

17:12.970 --> 17:14.470
Wow.

17:16.050 --> 17:20.060
Well, romance isn't all
fun and games, either.

17:20.060 --> 17:22.680
Like me getting cheated on in the game.

17:23.060 --> 17:24.310
That really sucks.

17:26.150 --> 17:27.440
<i>Sucks, huh?</i>

17:30.150 --> 17:31.480
<i>Uh-oh.</i>

17:31.480 --> 17:32.820
<i>I'm about to cry.</i>

17:34.860 --> 17:36.200
I'm going to the bathroom.

17:48.000 --> 17:49.080
<i>Oh.</i>

17:49.080 --> 17:50.840
<i>My clothes are all dirty.</i>

17:51.550 --> 17:53.710
<i>It must have happened when I tripped.</i>

17:57.130 --> 17:58.140
<i>Whoa.</i>

17:58.140 --> 18:00.300
<i>I scraped my leg, too.</i>

18:07.650 --> 18:11.070
<i>I wish I hadn't gone to that event.</i>

18:12.320 --> 18:14.400
<i>If I was going to end up
feeling like this...</i>

18:22.490 --> 18:23.740
<i>Hey...</i>

18:24.750 --> 18:26.830
<i>D-Did he...</i>

18:26.830 --> 18:28.750
<i>Don't tell me he left?</i>

18:29.500 --> 18:30.790
<i>I wouldn't put it past him.</i>

18:30.790 --> 18:33.420
<i>After all, he was just dying to go home.</i>

18:34.800 --> 18:36.670
<i>Not that it really matters.</i>

18:37.300 --> 18:39.680
<i>I was just forcing him
to stay with me, anyway.</i>

18:41.510 --> 18:42.510
<i>After all...</i>

18:43.060 --> 18:45.020
<i>from now on, I'm going to be alone.</i>

18:50.060 --> 18:51.150
Are you all right?

18:54.530 --> 18:55.360
Whoa.

18:57.150 --> 18:58.820
Why are you looking at me like that?

19:00.070 --> 19:02.950
Y-Y-Yama...

19:02.950 --> 19:03.830
Huh?

19:04.540 --> 19:07.120
Would you mind sitting down for now?

19:11.710 --> 19:12.630
Huh?

19:15.170 --> 19:16.340
What's that?

19:16.880 --> 19:18.420
Band-aids.

19:18.420 --> 19:20.630
I just bought them in, like, ten seconds.

19:23.100 --> 19:24.760
Oh, crap. It's sticking to me.

19:25.930 --> 19:27.730
I'm just going to put it on you.

19:37.780 --> 19:39.650
You went to buy them for me?

19:40.400 --> 19:43.160
Seeing all that blood worried me, so...

19:43.870 --> 19:45.740
So you went out of your way?

19:46.330 --> 19:47.370
Well...

19:47.750 --> 19:50.620
I also drank like, three colas.

19:56.000 --> 19:57.760
Yamada!

19:58.880 --> 20:00.930
Go ahead and order whatever you want!

20:00.930 --> 20:02.340
No, I'll be taking off now.

20:02.340 --> 20:03.890
We're so gonna drink tonight!

20:03.890 --> 20:05.010
Uh, um—

20:05.010 --> 20:06.890
May we order, please?

20:06.890 --> 20:08.640
My pleasure!

20:19.150 --> 20:22.150
So since Mr. Tani's
scouting the area...

20:28.330 --> 20:30.790
...we can focus on the enemy in front.

20:35.330 --> 20:37.040
We might be able to rack up some kills.

20:39.170 --> 20:41.050
<i>My head hurts.</i>

20:42.630 --> 20:44.130
The next map in particular...

20:45.090 --> 20:49.060
<i>Wait, I can hear someone talking.</i>

20:49.810 --> 20:52.350
I told you, I'm not turning on my camera.

20:54.520 --> 20:55.980
<i>Who is that?</i>

20:57.820 --> 20:59.360
You’re getting annoying.

21:09.200 --> 21:11.500
Hey, sorry.

21:11.950 --> 21:13.210
I'm gonna AFK for a sec.

21:13.960 --> 21:15.080
Be right back.

22:52.430 --> 22:53.600
Hmm.

22:54.180 --> 22:57.980
These free hairstyles
are anything but cute.

22:58.770 --> 23:02.020
And you can only get the cute ones
from loot boxes.

23:02.690 --> 23:05.070
So fat chance that I'd ever win one.

23:07.650 --> 23:10.950
<i>Huh? They sell them
for a fixed price, too?</i>

23:11.200 --> 23:14.830
<i>Not as good as the loot boxes,
but cuter than the default 'do!</i>

23:15.620 --> 23:20.500
<i>I see! You acquire it this way
to show off at least some personality!</i>

23:23.130 --> 23:26.130
<i>Hey, I just bought the cutest one
at a fixed price!</i>

23:26.420 --> 23:27.380
<i>Huh?</i>

23:34.600 --> 23:36.890
<i>We all had the same exact thought.</i>
